{"no":9,"title":"A Cold Welcome","titleZh":"冷遇","audio":"audio/L09.mp3","duration":90.6,"question":{"en":"What does 'a cold welcome' refer to?","zh":"“冷遇”指的是什么？"},"sentences":[{"i":0,"t":13.18,"t2":20.76,"en":"What does 'a cold welcome' refer to?","zh":"“冷遇”指的是什么？","meta":true},{"i":1,"t":20.76,"t2":25.25,"en":"On Wednesday evening, we went to the Town Hall.","zh":"星期三的晚上，我们去了市政厅。","chunks":[{"c":"PP","x":"to the Town Hall","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"PP","x":"On Wednesday evening","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"NP","x":"the Town Hall","g":"名词作定语/专名"},{"c":"NP","x":"Wednesday evening","g":"名词作定语/专名"}],"pat":"主谓","gp":["一般过去时","主谓句型"]},{"i":2,"t":25.25,"t2":34.45,"en":"It was the last day of the year and a large crowd of people had gathered under the Town Hall clock.","zh":"那是一年的最后一天，一大群人聚集在市政厅的大钟下面。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"was day","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"VP","x":"had gathered","g":"完成时态谓语"},{"c":"PP","x":"under the Town Hall clock","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"PP","x":"of the year","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"}],"pat":"主系表","gp":["一般过去时","主系表句型","并列结构"]},{"i":3,"t":34.45,"t2":38.94,"en":"It would strike twelve in twenty minutes' time.","zh":"再过20分钟，大钟将敲响12下。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"would strike twelve","g":"情态谓语"},{"c":"PP","x":"in twenty minutes ' time","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"NP","x":"twenty minutes ' time","g":"名词短语"}],"pat":"主谓宾","gp":["过去将来时","情态动词 would","主谓宾句型"]},{"i":4,"t":38.94,"t2":47.82,"en":"Fifteen minutes passed and then, at five to twelve, the clock stopped.","zh":"15分钟过去了，就在11点55分时，大钟停了。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"passed then","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"PP","x":"at five to twelve","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"SBAR","x":"Fifteen minutes passed and then","g":"宾语从句"},{"c":"NP","x":"Fifteen minutes","g":"名词短语"}],"pat":"主谓","gp":["一般过去时","宾语从句","主谓句型"]},{"i":5,"t":47.82,"t2":52.56,"en":"The big minute hand did not move.","zh":"那根巨大的分针不动了。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"did not move","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"NP","x":"The big minute hand","g":"冠词+形+名"}],"pat":"主谓","gp":["否定的 not","主谓句型"]},{"i":6,"t":52.56,"t2":57.66,"en":"We waited and waited, but nothing happened.","zh":"我们等啊等啊，可情况没有变化。","pat":"主谓","gp":["一般过去时","主谓句型","并列结构"]},{"i":7,"t":57.66,"t2":60.63,"en":"Suddenly someone shouted.","zh":"突然有人喊道：","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"Suddenly shouted","g":"动词短语"}],"pat":"主谓+状语","gp":["一般过去时","主谓+状语句型"]},{"i":8,"t":60.63,"t2":68.71,"en":"'It's two minutes past twelve! The clock has stopped!'","zh":"“已经12点零2分了！那钟已经停了！”","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"'s minutes","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"VP","x":"has stopped","g":"完成时态谓语"},{"c":"PP","x":"past twelve","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"NP","x":"two minutes","g":"名词短语"}],"pat":"主系表","gp":["一般现在时","主系表句型"]},{"i":9,"t":68.71,"t2":70.35,"en":"I looked at my watch.","zh":"我看了一下我的手表。","chunks":[{"c":"PP","x":"at my watch","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"NP","x":"my watch","g":"名词短语"}],"pat":"主谓","gp":["一般过去时","主谓句型"]},{"i":10,"t":70.35,"t2":71.84,"en":"It was true.","zh":"果真如此。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"was true","g":"动词短语"}],"pat":"主系表","gp":["一般过去时","主系表句型"]},{"i":11,"t":71.84,"t2":76.81,"en":"The big clock refused to welcome the New Year.","zh":"那座大钟不愿意迎接新年。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"to welcome Year","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"VP","x":"refused welcome","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"NP","x":"The big clock","g":"冠词+形+名"},{"c":"NP","x":"the New Year","g":"名词作定语/专名"}],"pat":"主谓","gp":["一般过去时","不定式","主谓句型"]},{"i":12,"t":76.81,"t2":86.81,"en":"At that moment, everybody began to laugh and sing.","zh":"此时，大家已经笑了起来，同时唱起了歌。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"began laugh","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"VP","x":"to laugh","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"PP","x":"At that moment","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"NP","x":"that moment","g":"冠词+名"}],"pat":"主谓","gp":["一般过去时","不定式","主谓句型"]}]}